        <mxCell id="note" value="Page 4 — a worked slice: what an SSO task traverses, end to end.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Measured 2026-09-20: all 5 SSO routing cases were correct, 3/3 samples each. Routing was never the problem. The two real gaps were a CONTENT gap (Golden SAML — in a skill that routed correctly and held nothing) and a CHECKLIST gap (state, whose rule lives in a different skill, so an auditor walking this skill&#x27;s checklist was never prompted)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
