        <mxCell id="m_sh" value="sota-shell-scripting (bash + zsh + PowerShell) — covered, and deliberately NOT a column: its spine is different, so a shared grid would imply comparisons that do not hold.&lt;br&gt;9 files, 3301 lines — larger than several language skills. zsh is treated as its own dialect throughout, not as a bash footnote." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
